OL,3,GNEWSACriminals publish data of 8.7m
OL,4,Apeople after airports hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FCriminal hackers have posted the
OL,7,Fpersonal data of nearly nine million
OL,8,Fpeople online after breaching three UK
OL,9,Fairports.
OL,11,FHackers extorted Manchester Airports
OL,12,FGroup (MAG) for an undisclosed amount
OL,13,Fbut failed to get their ransom paid.
OL,15,FCustomers of Manchester, London
OL,16,FStansted and East Midlands airports are
OL,17,Fbeing warned of secondary attacks as
OL,18,Fthe data is now available to other
OL,19,Fcriminals.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
