OL,3,GNEWSACriminals publish data of 8.7m
OL,4,Apeople after airports hack
OL,5,
OL,6,F"MAG is confident that we have taken
OL,7,Feffective measures to protect our
OL,8,Fcustomers and we have contacted all
OL,9,Fthose affected, including reaching out
OL,10,Fto all those with upcoming bookings to
OL,11,Fadvise them of additional support," the
OL,12,Fcompany said in a statement.
